accTitle: CDK changes the authoring model while retaining CloudFormation deployment
accDescr: Developers author TypeScript or Python constructs. A CodeBuild pipeline stage synthesizes templates and assets, and CloudFormation then owns resource creation and updates.
C[TypeScript or Python<br/>CDK constructs]:::inputData --> B[CodeBuild in CodePipeline<br/>Build, test and synthesize]:::process
B --> T[Cloud assembly<br/>Templates and assets]:::output
T --> F[CloudFormation stack deployment]:::process
F --> R[AWS resources<br/>Stack-managed lifecycle]:::output
